Package: axiora-shell-services
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dbus, libdbus-1-3, libglib2.0-0, gnome-shell (>= 45)
Maintainer: Axiora OS Team <hello@axiora.os>
Description: Axiora OS background daemons
 Background daemons for the Axiora OS desktop experience.
 Includes the notification daemon, dock daemon, and focus mode daemon.
 These services communicate over DBus to provide system integration
 for the Axiora Shell UI.
Homepage: https://axiora.os
